Additionally, Spring JDBC recently deprecated the query(String, Object[], RowMapper) signature. We just need to switch it to use standard varargs query(String, RowMapper, Object...) to clear that warning.
To fix this file completely, **delete processAdvancedApproval and any duplicate processWorkflowAction methods**, and replace them with these clean, dynamic, warning-free methods.
